    {
      "text": "一边驾驶飞船躲避轰击，一边管理自动炮塔清理无尽小行星带",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Void Miner is a retro-inspired roguelite asteroid shooter where you pilot a space ship and manage an automated tower to destroy endless fields of chaos.",
