      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "采掘小行星、回收资源并升级飞船，形成持续递增的采矿火力循环",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Void Miner is a incremental roguelite bullet hell that is about mining asteroids, collecting resources and upgrading your ship to blast through waves of asteroid belts.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3772240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从简易飞船起步探索升级树，最终把整片小行星带变成清场目标",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Start with a simple ship, picking off as many asteroids as you can. Explore the upgrade tree. Lay waste to the entire asteroid belt.",
